# Update Chat.tsx to Include Copy Functionality

## frontend/src/components/chat/Chat.tsx

### Import React Icon for Copy Button

```typescript
import { MdContentCopy } from 'react-icons/md';
```

### Add Utility Function for Copy-to-Clipboard Action

```typescript
const copyToClipboard = async (text: string) => {
  try {
    await navigator.clipboard.writeText(text);
    console.log('Message copied to clipboard');
  } catch (err) {
    console.error('Failed to copy text: ', err);
  }
};
```

### Modify Message Rendering to Include Copy Button

```typescript
return (
  <div className="flex flex-col gap-3">
    {messages.map((message, index) => (
      <div key={index} className="flex justify-between items-center p-2 bg-white shadow rounded-lg">
        <ChatMessage message={message} />
        <button
          onClick={() => copyToClipboard(message.text)}
          className="ml-2 p-1 rounded hover:bg-gray-200 focus:outline-none"
          aria-label="Copy message"
        >
          <MdContentCopy size={24} />
        </button>
      </div>
    ))}
    <div ref={endOfMessagesRef} />
  </div>
);
```

### Ensure Accessibility with ARIA Attributes

Ensure the button is accessible by adding appropriate ARIA attributes. The `aria-label` attribute has been added to the button for accessibility purposes.

## Modify ChatMessage Component for Better Styling

### frontend/src/components/chat/ChatMessage.tsx

### Adjust Styling to Accommodate Copy Button

```typescript
function ChatMessage({ message }: { message: Message }) {
  return (
    <div className="flex-1 min-w-0 break-words">
      <p className="text-sm text-gray-800">{message.text}</p>
    </div>
  );
}
```

### Ensure Proper Use of Space and Padding

Ensure proper use of space and padding to ensure that message text within each `ChatMessage` component does not overflow or clip due to the addition of a copy button.

## Enhance User Feedback on Copy Action

### frontend/src/components/Toast/ToastContainer.tsx

### Implement Toast Component for Notifications

```typescript
import React from 'react';
import { createPortal } from 'react-dom';

interface ToastProps {
  message: string;
  onClose: () => void;
}

const Toast: React.FC<ToastProps> = ({ message, onClose }) => {
  React.useEffect(() => {
    const timer = setTimeout(onClose, 3000);
    return () => clearTimeout(timer);
  }, [onClose]);

  return createPortal(
    <div className="fixed bottom-10 right-10 bg-blue-600 text-white p-3 rounded shadow-lg">
      {message}
    </div>,
    document.body
  );
};
```

This implementation enhances the user experience by providing a visual feedback when a message is copied to the clipboard.

